## Noncompete

Any purpose is a permitted purpose other than providing you
with any product or service that competes with the software
(or any product or service of the licensor that the software
adds value to), as of the date you first used the software.

## Fair Use

You may have "fair use" or other similar exceptions
under copyright or other law.  Nothing in this license
is intended to limit such exceptions.

## Other Laws

This license does not change your obligation to comply with
any other laws that apply to your use of the software, like
